# Optional API override. Unset defaults to http://localhost:8000 in development
# and the current website origin in production (single-service deployment).
# For a separately hosted API, uncomment and set its public HTTPS URL before building.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api.example.com

# The Solar & Battery tab (future work) is hidden by default. Uncomment to show it,
# then restart `npm run dev` or rebuild. Without rebuilding, open the page with ?energy=1.
# VITE_SHOW_ENERGY_TAB=1
